# ---- FPL26_VEX2_RETIME_CANDIDATE (aug05, DEFAULT OFF) ----------------------
# SECOND frozen-Tcl candidate for the shallow RECIPE_PASS: the q07 retime
# chain from the vex2 grid hunt (GRID_HUNT_VEX2_LOGICNETS_aug05.md wave 3).
# Evidence: wns -0.736 / fmax 433.65 = +36.19 alpha-class on vexriscv_v2,
# x3 cross-box (box6 original + box5 reps), BEATS the field high (+32.467
