        "FPL26_MUX_MD5_TRUST", "FPL26_NO_MUX_MD5_TRUST",
        # aug06 v4.1.2 (DEFAULT OFF; PREREG_V41_REV2_aug05.md v4.1.2
        # section): spam determinizer third shallow candidate — changes
        # a DECISION (whether the drilled -0.543 floor state is
        # registered at the finalize MUX), so flag + kill switch belong
